  title "The Weapon's Last Hunt"
  summary "Grul Grulrend an orca, undertakes a perilous journey through the frozen depths to retrieve Grungruk's Claw the trident weapon of his dead pod-brother Zund Gnasharkin which has been killing indiscriminately in the Thewsed Slew. He discovers the weapon is corrupted and fracturing, carrying Zund's dying rage and hunger for vengeance against the Berg. Meeting ☽'Netemia, a penguin from the Nightshelf who killed Zund, Grul Grulrend realizes the weapon cannot be safely wielded or returned to his pod. Instead, he chooses to leave it entombed in memory-ice at the Berg's deepest level, accepting that the trident will remain there waiting—a burden that cannot be abandoned but cannot be claimed, ensuring the cycle of violence will continue when the next orca inevitably seeks it."
